{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Hold,\" said David, perceiving that with this assurance they were about to leave him. \"I am an unworthy and humble follower of one who taught not the damnable principle of revenge.\"", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Hold", ",\"", " said", " David", ",", " per", "ceiving", " that", " with", " this", " assurance", " they", " were", " about", " to", " leave", " him", ".", " \"", "I", " am", " an", " unw", "orthy", " and", " humble", " follower", " of", " one", " who", " taught", " not", " the", " dam", "nable", " principle", " of", " revenge", ".\""], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
